yment systems, and business culture IS the product for foreign companies wanting SEA access, (2) Vietnamese-language content and SEA-market expertise is severely undersupplied vs demand — most AI tools and services are English-first, (3) The gap between what VN businesses need and what global SaaS provides is enormous — localization itself is a business, (4) Their low cost base means they can price BELOW global competitors while maintaining higher margins — this is structural, not temporary, (5) Forum-layer intelligence from Vietnamese communities (mmo4me, voz.vn) gives them operator-level market intelligence that English-language research cannot access.\"}"
